SeaUrchin: {
	DisplayName: Sea Urchin
	Bestiary: Tread carefully around the ocean floor, lest you get caught in the general direction of a tumbling urchin!
}

FrostEater: {
	DisplayName: Frost Biter
	Bestiary: The ancient spirits’ release has rendered the beasts of the Corruption with a stronger metabolism, enabling their spread into the coldest areas of the world.
}

Rimera: {
	DisplayName: Rimera
	Bestiary: With the ancient spirits being freed, the Crimson’s terrors remain just as bloodthirsty, enough to now persist in the frigid temperatures of the snow.
}
